%% ===== 4.1 首屏向导解锁（S1 自动探测，模拟）=====
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as 用户
    participant O as OverviewView
    participant S as UiStore
    participant SB as Sidebar
    U->>O: 点击「自动探测 PalServer.exe」
    O->>S: startDetect() (detecting=true)
    Note over O: setTimeout(1400ms) 模拟，禁 api.steam.detect
    O->>S: finishDetect("D:\Steam\...\PalServer")
    S->>SB: wizard.detected=true / detectedPath
    SB-->>U: 状态卡：已配置·待启动 + 绿点
    Note over S: step1→locked, step2→active

%% ===== 4.2 导航切换 =====
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as 用户
    participant N as Sidebar nav-item
    participant R as vue-router
    participant A as App.vue router-view
    U->>N: 点击导航
    N->>R: router.push(path)
    R->>A: 切换组件 (Transition 淡入)
    Note over N: active-class 由 route 驱动

%% ===== 4.3 折叠分组 / 搜索过滤（S2）=====
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as 用户
    participant G as CfgGroup
    participant C as ConfigView
    U->>G: 点击分组头
    G->>G: emit toggle() → collapsed 翻转
    G->>G: body v-show
    U->>C: 输入搜索
    C->>C: 展开所有 group + 按 name 过滤

%% ===== 4.4 Tooltip 显隐 =====
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as 用户
    participant I as InfoTip
    participant S as UiStore
    participant TT as Tooltip
    U->>I: mouseenter(ⓘ)
    I->>I: 计算锚点 rect
    I->>S: setTooltip(true, html, x, y)
    S-->>TT: 渲染气泡于(x,y)
    U->>I: mouseleave
    I->>S: hideTooltip() (80ms)

%% ===== 4.5 配置项内联编辑 + 保存态（S2，模拟）=====
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as 用户
    participant CI as CfgItem
    participant V as ConfigView
    participant T as Toast
    U->>CI: 点击数值 → 内联 input
    U->>CI: 输入 + Enter
    CI->>V: emit update:modelValue → 本地 config + dirty
    U->>V: 点击「保存配置」
    V->>T: toast.success("配置已保存（模拟）")
    Note over V: 不调 api.config.write()

%% ===== 4.6 模拟 RCON 收发（S4）=====
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as 用户
    participant R as RconView
    participant T as Terminal
    U->>R: 输入/快捷指令 SaveWorld 回车
    R->>R: 正则匹配 /^saveworld/i
    R->>T: appendLog(cmd, 'cmd')
    R->>T: appendLog("World saved successfully", 'resp')
    Note over R: 不调 api.rcon.send()
